Get the IPv4 network address (default)
```ts no-assert ignore
import { getNetworkAddress } from "@ende/net/unstable-get-network-address";

const hostname = getNetworkAddress()!;

Ende.serve({ port: 0, hostname }, () => new Response("Hello, world!"));
```

Get the IPv6 network address
```ts no-assert ignore
import { getNetworkAddress } from "@ende/net/unstable-get-network-address";

const hostname = getNetworkAddress("IPv6")!;

Ende.serve({ port: 0, hostname }, () => new Response("Hello, world!"));
```

